{"id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#thm:levi-civita-connection","title":"thm:levi-civita-connection","path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries.md","line":28,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries.tex#thm:levi-civita-connection","uses":["[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:riemannian-metric]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries.tex","label":"thm:levi-civita-connection","line":46,"source":"\\begin{theorem}[Levi-Civita connection]\n\\label{thm:levi-civita-connection}\n\n\\uses{def:riemannian-metric}\n\n\n\n\nFor every Riemannian metric $g$ there is a unique $\\mathbb R$-linear\nconnection\n\\[\n  \\nabla:\\Gamma(TM)\\longrightarrow\\Gamma(T^*M\\otimes TM)\n\\]\nsatisfying $\\nabla(fX)=df\\otimes X+f\\nabla X$ and, for all vector\nfields $X,Y$,\n\\begin{itemize}\n\\item[$\\bullet$] $d(g(X,Y))=g(\\nabla X,Y)+g(X,\\nabla Y)$\n  (metric compatibility);\n\\item[$\\bullet$] $\\nabla_XY-\\nabla_YX=[X,Y]$ (vanishing torsion),\n  where $\\nabla_XY=(\\nabla Y)(X)$.\n\\end{itemize}\n\\end{theorem}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Theorem</div></section>[Levi-Civita connection] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-74686d3a6c6576692d6369766974612d636f6e6e656374696f6e\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh01_Preliminaries%23def%3Ariemannian-metric\">↗ def:riemannian-metric</a> <p></p>For every Riemannian metric <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span> there is a unique <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\mathbb R$\">$\\mathbb R$</span>-linear connection <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  \\nabla :\\Gamma (TM)\\longrightarrow \\Gamma (T^*M\\otimes TM)  \\]\">\\[  \\nabla :\\Gamma (TM)\\longrightarrow \\Gamma (T^*M\\otimes TM)  \\]</span> satisfying <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\nabla (fX)=df\\otimes X+f\\nabla X$\">$\\nabla (fX)=df\\otimes X+f\\nabla X$</span> and, for all vector fields <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X,Y$\">$X,Y$</span>, <ul><li><p><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d(g(X,Y))=g(\\nabla X,Y)+g(X,\\nabla Y)$\">$d(g(X,Y))=g(\\nabla X,Y)+g(X,\\nabla Y)$</span> (metric compatibility); </p></li><li><p><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\nabla _XY-\\nabla _YX=[X,Y]$\">$\\nabla _XY-\\nabla _YX=[X,Y]$</span> (vanishing torsion), where <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\nabla _XY=(\\nabla Y)(X)$\">$\\nabla _XY=(\\nabla Y)(X)$</span>. </p></li></ul> ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:riemannian-metric","next":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#Koszul","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:riemannian-metric","title":"def:riemannian-metric","label":"def:riemannian-metric"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#lem:hessian-symmetric","title":"lem:hessian-symmetric","label":"lem:hessian-symmetric"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#hessform","title":"hessform","label":"hessform"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#def:riemann-curvature-tensor","title":"def:riemann-curvature-tensor","label":"def:riemann-curvature-tensor"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch01_Preliminaries#Bianchi","title":"Bianchi","label":"Bianchi"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/